   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Core support till ZNFU f&#xF6;r implementering av deras strategiska arbetsplan f&#xF6;r 2009-2013. Syftet med st&#xF6;det &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka livsmedelstryggheten, farminkomsterna, syssels&#xE4;ttningsm&#xF6;jligheterna och minska fattigdomsniv&#xE5;erna i landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the Zambia National farmers Union ZNFU to implement Strategic Work Plan 2009 - 2013. The objective: to contribute towards improved food security, farm incomes, employment opportunities and reduced poverty levels.Through: research, lobbying and advocacy function; member service provision and District Farmer Association outreach; management for results; HIV/AIDS, Gender &amp; Environment.</narrative>
